langganan sekarang","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Ends access now. Does not promise a refund.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ms","script":"Latn","concept":"billing.refund_requested","role":"status","text":"Permintaan bayaran balik telah dihantar","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. The request is recorded. The money is not necessarily back.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ms","script":"Latn","concept":"billing.refund_completed","role":"status","text":"Bayaran balik selesai","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. The refund has completed. Keep the amount and destination when the app provides them.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ms","script":"Latn","concept":"auth.resend_code","role":"button","text":"Hantar kod semula","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Sends another code. Does not say the previous code still works.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ms","script":"Latn","concept":"auth.code_expired","role":"status","text":"Kod ini sudah tamat tempoh","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. The code expired. That is different from a wrong code.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ms","script":"Latn","concept":"form.save_draft","role":"button","text":"Simpan draf","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Unpublished. Not Simpan for a finished form.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ms","script":"Latn","concept":"form.discard_changes","role":"button","text":"Buang perubahan","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Unsaved edits only.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ms","script":"Latn","concept":"item.delete_permanently","role":"button","text":"Padam secara kekal","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Irreversible.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ms","script":"Latn","concept":"content.download","role":"button","text":"Muat turun","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Download. Muat naik is upload.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ms","script":"Latn","concept":"search.clear_filters","role":"button","text":"Kosongkan penapis","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not a native-speaker review. Filters only.","source":{"id":"reference-only","url":"https://github.com/Kamaleshkabeerdoss/nativeskill/blob/main/skills/nativeskill/assets/concepts.json"}},{"locale":"ms","script":"Latn","concept":"billing.discount_savings","role":"label","text":"Jimat {amount}","status":"draft","note":"Unreviewed draft. Not source-attested and not 